      marco_legal: "The crime of robbery with violence or intimidation is provided for in articles 237 and following of the Criminal Code and carries prison sentences of two to five years when violence or intimidation concur. Membership in criminal organization is regulated in article 570 ter of the same code. Both criminal types require the accreditation of the accused's concrete participation and the existence of an organized structure. The defense recalled that Supreme Court case law requires a direct proof of integration and prohibits convicting based on mere suspicions."
